+# Where the wait frames go, and how fast they cycle: the line is pinned to the
+# panel edge and scales with the background (the script works in a 3840x2160
+# canvas), and a full-height fill wants a slower cycle than the little arc.
+frame_div=4; wait_pos="entry.cx - b.GetWidth() / 2, entry.cy - b.GetHeight() / 2"
